
### CREATE ONE CAT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/cats
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "name": "Cat Mikolo",
  "description": "White/Black"
}
> {%
    client.global.set("userId", response.body.id);
%}


### DELETE ONE CAT
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/cats/{{userId}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###

### GET ONE CAT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cats/{{userId}}
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

